msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nLanguage: zh_Hans\n"

msgid "Screen wallpaper"
msgstr "屏幕壁纸"

msgid "Everywhere"
msgstr "全部界面"

msgid "Home page"
msgstr "主页"

msgid "Signal page"
msgstr "信号页"

msgid "Traffic page"
msgstr "流量页"

msgid "Functions"
msgstr "功能列表"

msgid "Pages under Functions"
msgstr "功能里的各页"

msgid "Control centre and SMS list"
msgstr "控制中心和短信列表"

msgid "PIN pad"
msgstr "密码盘"

msgid "Pop-ups (QR code, SMS, power menu)"
msgstr "弹窗（二维码、短信、电源菜单）"

msgid "It plays on selected scenes while the screen is still and pauses on a touch, swipe or scrolling list. Playback uses additional CPU and battery; unselected scenes keep a still frame."
msgstr "在勾选的界面静止时播放，触摸、翻页或列表滚动时暂停。播放会增加 CPU 与电量消耗；未勾选的界面保持静态画面。"

msgid "It was converted in the older way (JPEG frames): set it again for a sharper picture and less work for the screen."
msgstr "这段动态壁纸采用旧版 JPEG 帧格式；重新选择原视频设置，可提升清晰度并减少屏幕处理开销。"

msgid "High refresh"
msgstr "高刷新"

msgid "Use 96 MHz during swipes and high frame rate wallpapers, returning to the stock 48 MHz when idle. Up to about 53 fps; off by default. This exceeds the panel's stock clock. Turn it off if you see specks, shifted lines or wrong colours."
msgstr "翻页和高帧率动态壁纸播放时使用 96 MHz，空闲后恢复原厂 48 MHz，最高约 53 帧/秒，默认关闭。此模式超出屏幕原厂时钟；若出现花点、错位或颜色异常，请关闭。"

msgid "%d fps (needs high refresh)"
msgstr "%d 帧/秒（需开启高刷新）"
